>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must be real-valued; complex dtypes are not supported)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 2 (out tensor, if provided, must have boolean dtype)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 0
>>
Rule 3 (out tensor, if provided, must have the same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)
